OL,3,AHuman extinction fears make me want to
OL,4,Aflee AI and live on an island
OL,5,
OL,6,FSince headlines broke about claims AI
OL,7,Fadvancement could lead to human
OL,8,Fextinction, James Downs has felt his
OL,9,Fanxiety rising.
OL,11,F"It makes me almost feel powerless.
OL,12,FLike, what can I do as an individual?"
OL,13,Fsaid the mental health campaigner from
OL,14,FCardiff.
OL,16,FThis sense of fear has led him to check
OL,17,Fhis phone for more news.
